iction (forces a queue), `INTARSIA_DEBUG_STALL_KV=n` sleeps n seconds after allocating KV (forces
OOM), `INTARSIA_DEBUG_STALL_KV_OOM=n` sleeps n seconds after an OOM (forces a 429). Use them to
stress-test the watchdog and the supervisor.

## Grafana dashboard

`deploy/grafana/intarsia.json` is a ready-made dashboard. It reads the metrics above and shows:
* `intarsia_engine_steps_total` (rate, 1m/5m)
* `intarsia_requests_{running,
